3.
Particulars to be displayed on label. -
(1)
On every washing machine, the following particulars shall be displayed on its label, namely: -
(a)
Star level;
(b)
The logo of the Bureau of Energy Efficiency;
Page 2/9

Bureau of Energy Efficiency (Particulars and Manner of their Display on Labels of Washing ...
(c)
name of appliance;
(d)
brand/make;
(e)
model/ year of manufacturing or import;
(f)
type of washing machine;
(g)
load Capacity;
(h)
water Consumption;
(i)
unique label series code;
(j)
label period.
(2)
The design, colour, size and content of label shall be as specified in the Schedule annexed to these regulations.
